			<TRAN tranid="obtre_comm_211r" trcode="obtre_comm_211r" compress="1" encryption="1" inputcheck="1" useattr="0" />
		</TRID_INFO>
		<TRIO_INFO>
			<TRAN name="obtre_comm_211r" title="해외CFD_증거금/예수금 조회" realdata="0" dessvr="9" >
				<TRBLOCK name="InBlock1" inout="in" _len="126" _ulen="94" >

ACNO^계좌번호^8^0^0^0^0^0^0
ASNO^계좌일련번호^2^0^0^0^0^0^0
