				</TRBLOCK>
				<TRBLOCK name="OutBlock1" inout="out" _len="1160" _ulen="906" >

CFD_MARG_GRAD_CODE^CFD증거금등급코드^1^0^0^0^0^0^0
CRCD^통화코드^3^0^0^0^0^0^0
DEAL_STND_EXRT^매매기준환율^11^4^7^0^0^0^0
ACNT_VLTN_AMT^계좌평가금액^20^6^7^0^0^0^0
CFD_PMARG^CFD포지션증거금^20^6^7^0^0^0^0
