CFD_ACNT_MGRT^CFD계좌증거금율^20^6^7^0^0^0^0
CFD_SPLM_EVDN_AMT^CFD추가증거금액^20^6^7^0^0^0^0
CFD_WNCR_TFAM^CFD원화예수금^20^6^7^0^0^0^0
CFD_FRCR_TFAM^CFD외화예수금^20^6^7^0^0^0^0
CFD_VLTN_PRLS_AMT^CFD평가손익금액^20^6^7^0^0^0^0
UI_CFD_OTST_CLRN_PRLS^UICFD미결제청산손익^20^6^7^0^0^0^0
UI_CFD_OTST_EXPN_SMTN^UICFD미결제비용합계^20^6^7^0^0^0^0
CFD_UNAM^CFD미수금^20^6^7^0^0^0^0
