DRNG_ABLE_FRCR_AMT^출금가능외화금액^20^3^7^0^0^0^0
CFD_MNTN_MARG^CFD유지증거금^20^6^7^0^0^0^0
UI_CFD_EXTA_MARG_TTAM^UICFD여유증거금총액^20^6^7^0^0^0^0
SPLM_EVDN_AMT^추가증거금액^20^6^7^0^0^0^0
UI_CFD_MARG_SMTN^UICFD증거금합계^20^6^7^0^0^0^0
CFD_TFAM^CFD예수금^20^6^7^0^0^0^0

				</TRBLOCK>
			</TRAN>
		</TRIO_INFO>
	</DATAIO_INFO>
